              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Knektpass is a traditional trick-taking card game using 36-card or 52-card French-suited Swedish pack for 2 or more players. It is a Rams-family game with dropping out, exchanging, and countdown points."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Knektpass is treated as a distinct traditional card game because the source identifies its own player count, pack, rank order, and trick-play objective rather than only listing it as a synonym."
            }
          ]
        },
